Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)">
I would like to say something plainly so there is no misconstruing my posit=
ion.</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; mar=
gin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,=
Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)">
I am entitled to the records you have claimed to not even search for yet. Y=
ou put up a fee wall expecting that to end the matter. It will not. I have =
paid for records with Oregon State Police - which is how I learned about yo=
ur involvement - and now with the
 Office of the Governor. Your $70 wall will not hold.</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; mar=
gin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,=
Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)">
I am not looking to embarrass anyone. If you did something embarrassing, I =
will overlook it if you are honest about it. If
<i>nothing</i> actually happened with Lane County, it doesn't even need to =
be in the archive, but right now, I have no way to confirm that.</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; mar=
gin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,=
Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)">
I live where your deputies work beside me and I have always treated them wi=
th respect and dignity. That will continue. This matter will be treated wit=
h professionalism throughout. I am asking for the same in return from you.<=
/div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; mar=
gin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,=
Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(33,33,33)">
Now for the plain part. You have until the end of day tomorrow to release e=
very record I've requested. If you do not, I will treat the request as deni=
ed and we will settle it in court.</div>
<div class=3D"x_elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; mar=
gin-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,=
